---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";

const steps = ["Retrieve", "Re-evaluate", "Replenish", "Document", "Celebrate"];
---

<Layout title="About Us" description="Agìkūyū Women and Men is a cultural heritage initiative founded in 2017 and formally registered in 2018.">
  <section class="page-hero">
    <img class="hero-img" src="/images/thirteen.jpg" alt="" width="1600" height="700" />
    <div class="hero-overlay"></div>
    <div class="hero-content">
      <p class="hero-eyebrow">About Us</p>
      <h1 class="hero-title">Who <em>We Are</em></h1>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section-wrap tight" style="padding-bottom: 20px;">
    <div class="eyebrow center" style="justify-content:center;">Mission Statement</div>
    <ol class="steps-strip reveal">
      {steps.map((s, i) => (
        <li><span class="step-num">{String(i + 1).padStart(2, "0")}</span><span class="step-name">{s}</span></li>
      ))}
    </ol>
    <p class="section-sub center reveal" style="max-width: 720px;">
      Retrieve → Re-evaluate → Replenish → Document → Celebrate Agìkūyū history, heritage, culture and Gìkūyū language.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section class="section-wrap">
    <div class="row reveal">
      <div class="prose">
        <div class="eyebrow">Who We Are</div>
        <p>
          Agìkūyū Women and Men is a cultural heritage initiative founded in 2017 and formally registered in 2018
          with a shared vision: to safeguard the wisdom, traditions, history, language and identity of the Agìkūyū people.
        </p>
        <p>
          We work to ensure that the knowledge carried by generations is not lost as societies change. Our focus includes
          the Gìkūyū language, oral literature, songs, traditions, indigenous knowledge, history, cultural practices and community memory.
        </p>
        <p>
          Our work recognizes that heritage is not simply something from the past. It is a living source of identity,
          knowledge and belonging that continues to shape how communities understand themselves and their place in the world.
        </p>
      </div>
      <img src="/images/nine.jpg" alt="Women in traditional dress" width="700" height="520" loading="lazy" />
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section-wrap tinted">
    <div class="prose narrow">
      <div class="prose-block reveal">
        <div class="eyebrow">Why We Exist</div>
        <p>
          <strong>We exist</strong> because much of our culture, history, and Agìkūyū heritage—our language, songs,
          oral literature, traditional knowledge, and community practices—is at risk of being forgotten in the face
          of modernization and globalization.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="prose-block reveal">
        <div class="eyebrow">Our Mission</div>
        <p>
          <strong>Our mission</strong> is to Retrieve, Re-evaluate, Replenish, Document, and to Celebrate Agìkūyū culture,
          history, and Gìkūyū language so that current and future generations can understand, honor, and carry forward
          their heritage with pride.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="prose-block reveal">
        <div class="eyebrow">Why This Is Important</div>
        <p>
          Our culture is the heartbeat of who we are as a people. Yet, many of our traditions and historical truths are
          disappearing as elders pass on and younger generations grow up disconnected from their roots. Preserving the
          Agìkūyū heritage is not just about remembering the past—it is about protecting identity, reclaiming pride, and
          ensuring that our stories, wisdom, and language continue to inspire generations to come. If we do not act now,
          we risk losing invaluable knowledge, practices, and perspectives that have shaped our community for centuries.
          This initiative ensures that our children and grandchildren will inherit not only our names but also the rich
          heritage that defines us.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="cta-strip">
    <p>Explore <a href="/our-work">Our Work</a> &middot; visit the <a href="/bookshop">Bookshop</a> &middot; <a href="/partner">Partner With Us</a></p>
  </section>
</Layout>
